# Dockerfile-specific ignore list: takes precedence over the upstream root .dockerignore, which whitelists
# only upstream sources and would drop mayhem/ and .git from the build context.
# Bake in the FULL repo (including .git history), dropping only build outputs and editor cruft.
# Lands at the fork root (the build context) when the template is copied in.

# ── Build outputs / local cruft ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Keep build artifacts out of the context — the COPY boundary is what separates
# source from artifacts. build.sh produces its outputs under /mayhem at build time.
# Adjust the patterns per project.
build/
out/
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
**/__pycache__/

# ── Editor / OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
